## 6. DATABASE RULES

- Engine: InnoDB. Charset: utf8mb4. All prices: DECIMAL(12,2). Timestamps: IST.
- All queries use parameterised statements (? placeholders). Never interpolate user input.
- Use INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE for upserts — never DELETE then INSERT.
- Connection pool is in src/config/db.js. Import pool from there. Never create a new connection directly.
- On startup (server.js): run SELECT 1 ping. If it fails, process.exit(1).
- Pool error handler: log and exit on fatal errors, warn on PROTOCOL_CONNECTION_LOST.
- Graceful shutdown: call pool.end() on SIGTERM/SIGINT.

Tables (never rename or add columns without a numbered migration file):
candles | indicators | features | signals | backtest_results |
favorites | fundamentals | sentiment_flags | paper_trades | adaptive_thresholds | _migrations

Migration numbering: Currently at 017. Next migration must be 018_*.sql.

