## 35. FORMATTING RULES

All formatting through src/utils/format.ts. Never inline in components.

formatINR(2450)           => "Rs.2,450.00"   (Indian numbering, en-IN locale)
formatPct(78)             => "78.00%"
formatPct(2.45, true)     => "+2.45%"         (showSign=true for PnL)
formatPct(-8.20, true)    => "-8.20%"
formatRR(2.14)            => "2.14x"
formatConfidence(78.5)    => "79"             (integer, no decimals)
formatDate('2026-03-23')  => "23 Mar 2026"
formatDateTime(isoStr)    => "23 Mar 2026, 10:15 PM IST"  (always IST)
formatShares(28)          => "28 shares"

PriceChange component rules:
- Positive value => green text + up arrow
- Negative value => red text + down arrow
- Zero => grey text + dash

ConfidenceBar colour thresholds:
- 70-79: amber | 80-89: light green | 90-100: green | below 70: grey (defensive)

